# HTH Pack Contract: v1
#   control: island-2.2
#   guide: https://howtoharden.com/guides/island/
#   profile: L1
#   mode: read-only
#   requires: Splunk Search; Island publisher add-on; dedicated confirmed index
# Replace island_browser with the approved index used only for Island audit data.
# HTH Guide Excerpt: begin check-audit-ingestion
index=island_browser earliest=-24h latest=now
| stats count as ingestedEventCount max(_time) as latestEventTimestamp
| eval latestEventAgeSeconds=if(ingestedEventCount>0, now()-latestEventTimestamp, null())
| fields ingestedEventCount latestEventTimestamp latestEventAgeSeconds
# HTH Guide Excerpt: end check-audit-ingestion
